  "articles": [
    {
      "title": "Web3 套利第 13 天：发现到执行一条链打通，零信号也是真结论",
      "author": "Paxon Qiao",
      "digest": "第十三天把发现、判定、执行三段串成一条管线，跑遍主流深池交出零信号。同批 90 篇笔",
      "content": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>MoonPub Preview</title>\n</head>\n<body style=\"margin:0;background:#f6f7f9;padding:24px 12px;\">\n<main style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto; background:#fff; padding:28px 24px; box-shadow:0 12px 36px rgba(15,23,42,0.08);\">\n<section style=\"font-family: -apple-system, 'PingFang SC', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.9; letter-spacing: 0.05em; color: #333; background: #fff; padding: 0 4px;\">\n\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>Cover</title>\n<style>\n*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}\nbody{width:900px;height:500px;overflow:hidden;font-family:'SF Pro Text',-apple-system,'PingFang SC','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;background:#030712}\n.cover{width:900px;height:500px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;background:radial-gradient(circle at 78% 18%,rgba(34,197,94,.22),transparent 25%),linear-gradient(135deg,#020617 0%,#0b1020 48%,#111827 100%);color:#e5edf7;padding:64px 76px}\n.grid{position:absolute;inset:0;background-image:linear-gradient(rgba(148,163,184,.08) 1px,transparent 1px),linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(148,163,184,.08) 1px,transparent 1px);background-size:34px 34px;opacity:.65}\n.glow{position:absolute;right:74px;top:54px;width:220px;height:220px;border:1px solid rgba(34,197,94,.28);border-radius:50%;box-shadow:0 0 60px rgba(34,197,94,.16)}\n.panel{position:relative;height:100%;border:1px solid rgba(148,163,184,.22);border-radius:18px;background:rgba(2,6,23,.72);box-shadow:0 22px 55px rgba(0,0,0,.35);padding:38px 44px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center}\n.toolbar{position:absolute;top:20px;left:24px;display:flex;gap:8px}\n.dot{width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;background:#22c55e;box-shadow:0 0 16px rgba(34,197,94,.8)}\n.dot:nth-child(2){background:#38bdf8;box-shadow:0 0 14px rgba(56,189,248,.7)}\n.dot:nth-child(3){background:#f59e0b;box-shadow:0 0 14px rgba(245,158,11,.65)}\n.tag{display:inline-block;color:#86efac;font-size:11px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:4px;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:24px}\n.prompt{color:#22c55e;margin-right:10px}\n.title{font-size:42px;font-weight:900;line-height:1.16;color:#f8fafc;max-width:640px;margin-bottom:18px;letter-spacing:.4px;text-shadow:0 0 24px rgba(34,197,94,.16)}\n.subtitle{font-size:16px;color:#a7b6c8;line-height:1.75;max-width:560px;margin-bottom:34px}\n.meta{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;color:#94a3b8;font-size:13px}\n.chip{border:1px solid rgba(34,197,94,.32);border-radius:999px;padding:7px 13px;color:#bbf7d0;background:rgba(34,197,94,.08);font-family:'SF Mono',Consolas,monospace}\n.author{letter-spacing:1px}\n.scanline{position:absolute;left:0;right:0;bottom:62px;height:1px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,#22c55e,transparent);opacity:.75}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"cover\" data-cover-style=\"geek-black\">\n  <div class=\"grid\"></div><div class=\"glow\"></div>\n  <section class=\"panel\">\n    <div class=\"toolbar\"><span class=\"dot\"></span><span class=\"dot\"></span><span class=\"dot\"></span></div>\n\n    <h1 class=\"title\">Web3 套利第 13 天：发现到执行一条链打通，零信号也是真结论</h1>\n    <p class=\"subtitle\">第十三天把发现、判定、执行三段串成一条管线，跑遍主流深池交出零信号。同批 90 篇笔记筛出五个强信号：会计重估、路由翻牌、费率证伪、股票基差、OI 过滤，并落地第一个增量过滤器。</p>\n    <div class=\"meta\"><span class=\"chip\">WEB3 · DEV</span><span class=\"author\">Paxon Qiao</span></div>\n    <div class=\"scanline\"></div>\n  </section>\n</main>\n</body>\n</html>\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 19px; font-weight: 800; color: #1a1a1a; margin: 2.3em 0 1em; padding: 0 0 10px 14px; border-left: 5px solid #2c2c2c; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb; letter-spacing: 1px; line-height:1.45;\">Web3 套利第 13 天：发现到执行一条链打通，零信号也是真结论</h2>\n\n<section style=\"margin: 1.9em 0; padding: 18px 20px 18px 24px; background: #f8f8f8; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-left: 4px solid #2c2c2c; border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(15,23,42,0.05); color: #888; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.9; letter-spacing: 0.08em;\">链上套利残酷共学 · 第 13 天\n2026-08-17</section>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.55em; color: #555; font-size: 16px; line-height: 2.05; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify;\">第十一天落下第一笔实弹，第十二天把它升级成可复跑的管线。第十三天要回答一个更根本的问题：这套管线能不能自己发现机会、自己判定、自己执行？</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">答案是能。把发现、判定、执行三段串成一条链，跑遍主流深池，交出零信号。这个零不是空转，是经过验证的结论。同一天还消化了 90 篇同学笔记，筛出五个强信号，并把第一个增量落成了能跑的过滤器。</p>\n\n<section style=\"margin: 2.2em 0; text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;width:42px;height:2px;background:#e5e7eb;vertical-align:middle;\"></section><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:6px;height:6px;border:1px solid #2c2c2c;border-radius:50%;margin:0 10px;vertical-align:middle;background:#fff;\"></span><section style=\"display:inline-block;width:42px;height:2px;background:#e5e7eb;vertical-align:middle;\"></section></section>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 19px; font-weight: 800; color: #1a1a1a; margin: 2.3em 0 1em; padding: 0 0 10px 14px; border-left: 5px solid #2c2c2c; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb; letter-spacing: 1px; line-height:1.45;\">一、90 篇笔记，五个强信号</h2>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">下午先干了一件信息密度很大的活：把共学群里新增的 90 篇同学笔记全部归档、提取、分章消化。3 个子代理并行精读，人工再抽 4 篇交叉校验，最后合成一份 digest。这 90 篇里最强的五条线：</p>\n\n<section style=\"margin:22px 0;padding:12px 14px;background:#f8f8f8;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:10px;\">\n<section style=\"margin:0 0 12px;padding:12px 14px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:8px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">信号</span>状态跳变捕捉</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">一句话</span>ERC-4626 金库 accrueInterest 会计重估是第 10 类机会，+0.0031% × 2772 万闪贷 = +869.65 美元</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">落到我们管线的动作</span>事件驱动清单新增「协议会计状态重估」维度</p>\n</section>\n<section style=\"margin:0 0 12px;padding:12px 14px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:8px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">信号</span>LI.FI 路由每周翻牌</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">一句话</span>AcrossV4 一夜接管 13/14 条跨链路径，L2 native USDC 被 deny list，最便宜的桥每周易主</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">落到我们管线的动作</span>跨链 scanner 每天重测排名，硬编码 USDC.e fallback</p>\n</section>\n<section style=\"margin:0 0 12px;padding:12px 14px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:8px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">信号</span>费率躺平证伪</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">一句话</span>Hyperliquid 250 天回测，最好 ETH 净年化仅 5.0%，SOL 是 -1.2%，符号每月翻转 70 到 90 次</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">落到我们管线的动作</span>funding 信号只看事件窗口，不做躺平收租假设</p>\n</section>\n<section style=\"margin:0 0 12px;padding:12px 14px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:8px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">信号</span>代币化股票基差</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">一句话</span>CEX 到 Hyperliquid 的价差是 CEX 之间的 5 到 20 倍，CRWD 中位 52bps 持续一小时</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">落到我们管线的动作</span>币股线新增 RWA 基差分支，方向符号纪律</p>\n</section>\n<section style=\"margin:0 0 12px;padding:12px 14px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:8px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">信号</span>OI 陷阱过滤</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">一句话</span>价格可画、深度可挂假单，OI 变化速率骗不了人，野庄对倒先拉 OI 再 ADL</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">落到我们管线的动作</span>funding 信号层加 OI 平稳性过滤</p>\n</section>\n</section>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">这五条不是零散的读书笔记，每一条都带互证、带数字、带落地动作。比如费率躺平证伪，直接用 250 天公开数据把「年化 43.8% 收租」证伪，符号翻转 70 到 90 次说明高费率是事件不是常态。再比如 OI 陷阱，Bitget 一个 4000 万 OI 的仓位开仓后一分钟被 ADL 剪到 200 万，复盘 95% 是野庄对倒，价格和深度都能造假，唯独 OI 的速率骗不了人。</p>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 19px; font-weight: 800; color: #1a1a1a; margin: 2.3em 0 1em; padding: 0 0 10px 14px; border-left: 5px solid #2c2c2c; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb; letter-spacing: 1px; line-height:1.45;\">二、发现到执行，串成一条链</h2>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">管线是第十二天的主角，但那时候的管线只会提交现成的交易。第十三天给它装上大脑：复用模拟器的池子模型，自己从 DexScreener 拉真实深池，自己判定跨池搬和往返有没有净利，有正利润才接 Jupiter 报价和 Jito bundle 提交。</p>\n\n<section style=\"margin:24px 0;\">\n<section style=\"margin:0 0 10px;padding:14px 16px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:10px;\">\n<section style=\"display:inline-block;width:24px;height:24px;background:#2c2c2c;color:#fff;font-weight:bold;text-align:center;line-height:24px;border-radius:50%;font-size:13px;margin:0 8px 0 0;vertical-align:top;\">1</section>\n<section style=\"display:inline-block;width:86%;vertical-align:top;\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:14px;color:#555;line-height:1.8;\">发现：DexScreener 拉 SOL 对 USDC 的真实深池，按流动性取前六名</p></section>\n</section>\n<section style=\"margin:0 0 10px;padding:14px 16px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:10px;\">\n<section style=\"display:inline-block;width:24px;height:24px;background:#2c2c2c;color:#fff;font-weight:bold;text-align:center;line-height:24px;border-radius:50%;font-size:13px;margin:0 8px 0 0;vertical-align:top;\">2</section>\n<section style=\"display:inline-block;width:86%;vertical-align:top;\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:14px;color:#555;line-height:1.8;\">判定：复用模拟器池模型跑跨池搬和往返，净利超过 2 bps 且扣掉 gas 仍为正才算路径</p></section>\n</section>\n<section style=\"margin:0 0 10px;padding:14px 16px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:10px;\">\n<section style=\"display:inline-block;width:24px;height:24px;background:#2c2c2c;color:#fff;font-weight:bold;text-align:center;line-height:24px;border-radius:50%;font-size:13px;margin:0 8px 0 0;vertical-align:top;\">3</section>\n<section style=\"display:inline-block;width:86%;vertical-align:top;\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:14px;color:#555;line-height:1.8;\">执行：正利润路径接 Jupiter 官方 swap 端点，组装交易交给 Jito 区块引擎</p></section>\n</section>\n</section>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.55em; color: #555; font-size: 16px; line-height: 2.05; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify;\">三段打通之后，管线第一次有了完整的生命周期：从市场里发现、用成本模型判定、有肉才动手。</p>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 19px; font-weight: 800; color: #1a1a1a; margin: 2.3em 0 1em; padding: 0 0 10px 14px; border-left: 5px solid #2c2c2c; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb; letter-spacing: 1px; line-height:1.45;\">三、第一轮跑完，混进了假池子</h2>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">dry-run 第一轮就暴露问题。判定结果忽正忽负，路径乱得没法看。查了数据源才发现，DexScreener 的搜索接口把 Base、BSC、ETH 主网上的 SOL 对 USDC 池也混了进来，Aerodrome、PancakeSwap、Uniswap 的池子储备数量级完全不一样，直接污染跨池判定。</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">修复只有一行：拉池时强制 <code style=\"background:#f5f5f5;padding:2px 4px;border-radius:3px;font-size:14px;font-family:monospace;\">chainId == &quot;solana&quot;</code>。加上过滤之后，只剩 3 个 Raydium 深池，9 条路径全部输出为负。</p>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 19px; font-weight: 800; color: #1a1a1a; margin: 2.3em 0 1em; padding: 0 0 10px 14px; border-left: 5px solid #2c2c2c; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb; letter-spacing: 1px; line-height:1.45;\">四、零信号，也是真结论</h2>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">9 条路径全负，听起来像白跑。但这是整个管线第一次独立运行给出的答案，而且和已有证据完全互证：主流池的常驻价差早就被磨平了，肉在事件窗口和机制错位里。零信号意味着两件事：</p>\n\n<section style=\"margin:24px 0;padding:0;background:#f8f8f8;border:1px solid #2c2c2c;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0;padding:10px 14px;background:#2c2c2c;color:#fff;font-weight:bold;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;letter-spacing:0.12em;\">🧠 零信号 = 验证通过</p>\n<section style=\"padding:14px 16px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#1a1a1a;\">一是管线真的在工作，发现、判定、执行三段逻辑没有短路，输出和知识图谱、哨兵结论一致。二是主流池确实没有常驻机会，与其在死水上撒网，不如把力量留给事件窗口。</section>\n</section>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.55em; color: #555; font-size: 16px; line-height: 2.05; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify;\">这段的价值在流程本身。跑出零信号是正确输出，说明管线可复跑、有判定逻辑、结论可核对。下次放进事件驱动的真实信号，跑出来的正利润路径才有说服力。</p>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 19px; font-weight: 800; color: #1a1a1a; margin: 2.3em 0 1em; padding: 0 0 10px 14px; border-left: 5px solid #2c2c2c; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb; letter-spacing: 1px; line-height:1.45;\">五、第一个增量落地：OI 陷阱过滤器</h2>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">digest 里五条强信号，第一条落地的是 OI 陷阱过滤器。把 062 的规则写成独立脚本，只读不碰现有哨兵：</p>\n\n<section style=\"margin: 18px 0 22px; padding: 4px 0;\">\n<table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;\">\n<tr><td style=\"width:34px;padding:8px 0 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#f3f4f6;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:7px;height:7px;background:#2c2c2c;border-radius:50%;vertical-align:middle;\"></span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;background:#f3f4f6;color:#555;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;\">读 4 币 × 3 所 × 10 天采样，算短期 OI 和基线的比值</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width:34px;padding:8px 0 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#fff;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:7px;height:7px;background:#2c2c2c;border-radius:50%;vertical-align:middle;\"></span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;background:#fff;color:#555;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;\">funding 达标但 OI 陡增超 1.25 倍，标陷阱嫌疑直接排除</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width:34px;padding:8px 0 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#f3f4f6;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:7px;height:7px;background:#2c2c2c;border-radius:50%;vertical-align:middle;\"></span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;background:#f3f4f6;color:#555;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;\">OI 骤降到 0.8 倍以下，标出清观察</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width:34px;padding:8px 0 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#fff;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:7px;height:7px;background:#2c2c2c;border-radius:50%;vertical-align:middle;\"></span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;background:#fff;color:#555;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;\">其余算平稳，正常输出信号</td></tr>\n</table></section>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">实测一轮，4 币 3 所全绿，比值都在 0.977 到 1.034 之间。DOGE 的 funding 刚好摸到 0.0100% 阈值，但 OI 平稳，按规则正常输出不标陷阱。没有陷阱就是正确的输出。</p>\n\n<section style=\"margin:24px 0;padding:0;background:#f8f8f8;border:1px solid #2c2c2c;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0;padding:10px 14px;background:#2c2c2c;color:#fff;font-weight:bold;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;letter-spacing:0.12em;\">📌 学习机制小改</p>\n<section style=\"padding:14px 16px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#1a1a1a;\">费曼 15 分钟复述取消了，改成每天一个知识点、用自己的话复述、Hermes 纠正补充。要小、一次一个、说人话。</section>\n</section>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 19px; font-weight: 800; color: #1a1a1a; margin: 2.3em 0 1em; padding: 0 0 10px 14px; border-left: 5px solid #2c2c2c; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb; letter-spacing: 1px; line-height:1.45;\">六、明天做什么</h2>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.55em; color: #555; font-size: 16px; line-height: 2.05; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify;\">第十三天收成三件事。管线第一次拥有完整的生命周期，从发现到执行一条链打通。90 篇笔记消化成五条带数字、带互证的强信号。OI 陷阱过滤器落地，digest 增量开始变成能跑的脚本。</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">明天的功课是把 digest 里剩余的可执行增量逐条过证据台账：跨链 scanner 每天重测排名、CEX 到 DEX 扫描器改用天然价差基线、ADL 剪刀仓预案。管线继续整合，把模拟器选出的正利润路径真正接进 quote、swap、bundle 链。</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">发现到执行一条链打通，零信号也是真结论，第十三天收盘。</p>\n\n<section style=\"margin: 2.2em 0; text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;width:42px;height:2px;background:#e5e7eb;vertical-align:middle;\"></section><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:6px;height:6px;border:1px solid #2c2c2c;border-radius:50%;margin:0 10px;vertical-align:middle;background:#fff;\"></span><section style=\"display:inline-block;width:42px;height:2px;background:#e5e7eb;vertical-align:middle;\"></section></section>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 19px; font-weight: 800; color: #1a1a1a; margin: 2.3em 0 1em; padding: 0 0 10px 14px; border-left: 5px solid #2c2c2c; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb; letter-spacing: 1px; line-height:1.45;\">关于本次共学</h2>\n\n<section style=\"margin:24px 0;padding:0;background:#f8f8f8;border:1px solid #2c2c2c;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0;padding:10px 14px;background:#2c2c2c;color:#fff;font-weight:bold;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;letter-spacing:0.12em;\">📌 关于本次共学</p>\n<section style=\"padding:14px 16px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#1a1a1a;\">本系列来自「<strong style=\"color: #1a1a1a;\">链上套利残酷共学</strong>」——由 Bruce Xu 发起的 <strong style=\"color: #1a1a1a;\">21 天实践型共学</strong>（2026.08.05–08.26），<strong style=\"color: #1a1a1a;\">571 位伙伴</strong>围绕机会发现、成本验证、策略构建、信号监控与执行复盘，用真实证据逼近答案，不做只听概念不落地的学习。\n\n🔗 活动详情：<a href=\"https://intensivecolearn.ing/programs/b43d2e97-ed88-4ca3-b12f-7ef672b01205\" style=\"color:#2c2c2c;font-weight:bold;text-decoration:none;border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;\">intensivecolearn.ing/programs/b43d2e97…</a></section>\n</section>\n\n\n\n<section style=\"margin-top:3em;padding-top:2em;border-top:1px solid #e8e8e8;\">\n\n<p style=\"margin:1em 0;color:#888;font-size:15px;text-align:center;\">— · —</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0.6em 0;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:15px;text-align:center;font-weight:bold;\">寻月隐君</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0.6em 0;color:#888;font-size:14px;text-align:center;line-height:1.8;\">专注 Web3、Python、Go、Rust 技术分享，探索区块链、智能合约、DApp 等前沿内容。<br>\n技术的光，未来的道。</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:1em 0 0.4em;color:#888;font-size:13px;text-align:left;line-height:1.8;\">本文为个人学习记录，不构成投资建议。链上套利有风险，请自行评估。</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:1.2em 0 0.6em;color:#888;font-size:13px;text-align:center;\">长按下方二维码即可入阁。若二维码过期，请在公众号后台回复 加群 获取最新二维码。</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center;margin:1.5em 0 0.8em;\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/22kVflKPKazib4FNWmo2NlTqn56ADA1zZHDtceEpa7YqCdGs6xlGZpapY3swotg4QibdWVKia9ky0KMdpf37dicUcu64tu3ljXDL42e1L9ZwiaNA/0?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg\" style=\"display:block;margin:0 auto;max-width:80%;width:240px;height:auto;\" alt=\"群二维码\"></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center;margin:1.5em 0 0.8em;\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/22kVflKPKayxQiakBJKZmbBxPBAjKDZ7vMv7ibe3iclr8JqnYa14YkAAfGFibelb5tdicPLMicEIYdg5CibrOB2qdMODkLd3RFL07q9UZaqlicGIPM4/0?wx_fmt=jpeg&from=appmsg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" alt=\"关注\"></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0.8em 0;color:#888;font-size:13px;text-align:center;\">关注《寻月隐君》，一起在技术的星空下寻找属于自己的明月。</p>\n\n</section>\n\n\n</section>\n\n</main>\n</body>\n</html>\n"
    }
  ]
}
